  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"archive-header\">\n\n\t<h1 class=\"archive-title\">Harwich Community Center</h1>\n\n\t\n\t\n</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-5691 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-events category-news tag-coa tag-harwich-community-center\" id=\"post-5691\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/seeking-spring-and-easter-themed-cards-for-coa/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"985\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A couple of envelopes with flowers on them.\" src=\"/media/archive/1b885a4b5b8dc3895bc973ccf180646b4eb6265df07af1c4afcb99eed8f4f451.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/seeking-spring-and-easter-themed-cards-for-coa/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Seeking Spring and Easter Themed Cards for COA</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2021-03-08T09:27:04-05:00\" title=\"Monday, March 8, 2021, 9:27 am\">March 8, 2021</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Valentine cards made by Guild members for the Harwich COA lunch program were well received. Harwich COA director Emily Mitchell shared with event coordinator Peggy Rose, “recipients love getting little extras <a href=\"/news/seeking-spring-and-easter-themed-cards-for-coa/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-5577 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-news tag-council-on-aging tag-harwich-community-center\" id=\"post-5577\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/art-for-good/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-equal thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"1025\" height=\"431\" alt=\"A variety of cards with butterflies and flowers on them.\" src=\"/media/archive/4fe07b1d05b7789eba95e23f104db28dceb67b958a521698c455f230b7d3d0b9.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/art-for-good/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Art For Good</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2021-01-21T19:08:19-05:00\" title=\"Thursday, January 21, 2021, 7:08 pm\">January 21, 2021</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Donna Tavano and Peg Rose are asking for your help to bring some much needed “sunshine” to our local community in need.  Guild members are asked to decorate the cover of <a href=\"/news/art-for-good/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-4202 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-education category-monthly-meetings category-gallery-artists category-news tag-cape-cod-artist tag-free-demonstration tag-harwich-community-center tag-larry-folding tag-watercolor-artist\" id=\"post-4202\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/larry-folding-watercolor-painting-demonstration/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"804\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A watercolor painting of a house on a hill.\" src=\"/media/archive/379ba606fbdae582f87cf1d59d143bd811645428266aa47993e8f308d9a11916.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/larry-folding-watercolor-painting-demonstration/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Larry Folding – Watercolor Painting Demonstration</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2019-04-13T15:41:11-04:00\" title=\"Saturday, April 13, 2019, 3:41 pm\">April 13, 2019</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Guild of Harwich Artists Meeting – Saturday, April 20, 2:00-4:00 pm Harwich Community Center, 100 Oak Street, Harwich 02645 Free and Open to the Public – Refreshments will be served. <a href=\"/news/larry-folding-watercolor-painting-demonstration/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder has-excerpt post-4112 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-education category-monthly-meetings category-news tag-art-cape-cod tag-harwich-community-center tag-julie-blanchard\" id=\"post-4112\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/february-guest-artist-julie-blanchard/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"338\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A watercolor painting of flowers in a vase.\" src=\"/media/archive/2a76972f23b3f4a95d3395b15fee510cf513b77b163e0ce3f928c51b29b68afe.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/february-guest-artist-julie-blanchard/\" rel=\"bookmark\">February Guest Artist, Julie Blanchard</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2019-02-06T21:44:32-05:00\" title=\"Wednesday, February 6, 2019, 9:44 pm\">February 6, 2019</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Julie Blanchard joins us as the February guest artist. The Guild of Harwich Artists hold monthly meetings January through May, and September through November, at the Harwich Community Center, 100 Oak Street, Harwich, MA. Each meeting features a well-known Cape artist demonstrator. All programs are free and open to the public. #ForArtAndCommunity #GuildOfHarwichArtists #CapeCod</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3820 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-plein-air category-monthly-meetings category-gallery-artists category-news tag-cape-cod-art-galleries tag-cape-cod-artist tag-harwich-community-center tag-harwich-ma tag-harwich-port tag-paint-the-town tag-the-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-wet-sale tag-wychmere-harbor\" id=\"post-3820\">\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/annual-paint-the-town-saturday-june-16/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Annual Paint The Town, Saturday June 16</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-06-12T01:53:26-04:00\" title=\"Tuesday, June 12, 2018, 1:53 am\">June 12, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Annual “Paint The Town” en plein air event will be held Saturday, June 16 from 9:00 am – noon. Watch for Guild of Harwich Artists in the following locations: Harwich <a href=\"/news/annual-paint-the-town-saturday-june-16/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3819 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-news tag-cape-cod tag-cape-cod-artist tag-harwich-community-center tag-harwich-ma tag-harwich-port tag-monthly-meetings tag-paint-the-town tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-the-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-the-warm-side-of-the-cape\" id=\"post-3819\">\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/guild-sponsors-free-art-events-june-16/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Guild Sponsors Free Art Events June 16</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-06-11T13:59:12-04:00\" title=\"Monday, June 11, 2018, 1:59 pm\">June 11, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Dear Artists and Art Lovers: YOU’RE INVITED! The Guild of Harwich Artists invites you to a “Make and Take” event When? Saturday, June 16, 2018, 1:30p.m. to 4:00p.m. Where? Harwich <a href=\"/news/guild-sponsors-free-art-events-june-16/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t<nav class=\"navigation pagination\" aria-label=\"Posts pagination\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"screen-reader-text\">Posts pagination</h2>\n\t\t<div class=\"nav-links\"><span class=\"page-numbers current\">1</span>\n<a class=\"page-numbers\" title=\"Archived control; this function is not available here\" href>2</a><span data-fidelity-note=\"functional\" class=\"note\"> (archived control)</span>\n<a class=\"page-numbers\" title=\"Archived control; this function is not available here\" href>3</a><span data-fidelity-note=\"functional\" class=\"note\"> (archived control)</span>\n<a class=\"next page-numbers\" title=\"Archived control; t